FORKING IS ENCOURAGED:

This handbook is built to be forked, translated, specialised, and extended.
Fork it for your language, your industry, your framework, your region. Strip
out what does not apply and add what does. The only thing asked in return is
the credit line and link back that the license above already requires.

If you build something substantial on top of it, open an issue and it will be
linked from this repository.

